From 212ac35f783c638f20e54441770aae3d005af7a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@Averys-MacBook-Air.local>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 08:41:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/59] MetalSharp runtime as shipped (bundles release,
 2026-10-14)

The Wine 11.17 (MetalSharp 1.0) tree the bundles release's runtime was built
from, until now uncommitted: MetalSharp versioning, x86_64 ntdll.so with
pipe2 gated to macOS 27+, GSBASE/TEB switching for DXMT processes, msync
(replacing WFUSync), the x87 cooperative hook, and the launcher, graphics
policy and winemac changes that went with them.
